OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fspreading southeast for a time this
OL,7,Fmorning. Turning drier and eventually
OL,8,Fbrighter from the west during this
OL,9,Fafternoon. Warm in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,12,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,13,Fwith variable amounts of cloud.
OL,14,FBecoming chilly in some sheltered
OL,15,Fglens.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FAll parts will have a dry
OL,18,Fday with some sunshine in the morning,
OL,19,Fturning cloudier in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
